# Local fallback so scripts/capture_node.mjs can capture ESPN without a Chrome login,
# for when Claude in Chrome hits a 401 (your ESPN session logged out).
#
# 1. Copy this file to .env.espn.local (already gitignored via the .env* rule — never
#    commit the copy).
# 2. In Chrome, while logged into fantasy.espn.com: DevTools > Application > Cookies >
#    https://fantasy.espn.com. Copy the Value column for these two cookies:
#      espn_s2  -> ESPN_S2 below
#      SWID     -> ESPN_SWID below (keep the curly braces, e.g. {ABC123-...})
# 3. Fill in the two values below. Nothing else reads this file but
#    scripts/capture_node.mjs, and it never prints or writes them anywhere.
#
# These expire same as your Chrome session (weeks, usually) — when capture_node.mjs
# also starts failing, come back here and refresh both values the same way.

ESPN_S2=
ESPN_SWID=
